# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
# Keeps the build context small (samples/ and .git are ~750MB each) and keeps
# .env — which holds real AWS credentials — out of the daemon entirely.
#
# NOTE: adding a COPY to the Dockerfile means adding a matching !rule here.
*

!entrypoint
!cantaloupe.properties.sample
!delegates.rb
